    <values><field>LongDescription__c</field><value xsi:type="xsd:string">Finds: blng__LegalEntity__c records missing one or more address fields (street/city/postal/country).
Why it matters: Invoices print with blanks where the remit-to address should be. Customers can&apos;t process payment and finance has to manually re-issue, slowing cash collection.
Suppress a finding: for placeholder entities used only for internal cost allocation, never customer-facing.
Disable the detector: only if invoice templates pull addresses from elsewhere. Most should leave this on.</value></values>
